# Formats and lints only what is staged, then typechecks the project.
#
# Runs on the host, not in DDEV: prettier, eslint, tsc and twig-cs-fixer are all
# pure JS or PHP and work natively (only `vite build` needs the container, for
# rollup's Linux binary). Shelling into `ddev exec` here would add seconds per
# commit and fail outright whenever the project happens to be stopped.
npx lint-staged

# Project-wide, so it cannot run per staged file. ~1.5s, and it catches the class
# of breakage that formatting cannot.
npx tsc --noEmit
